<title>USA: CheckFree to service KeyCorp processing.</title>
<headline>CheckFree to service KeyCorp processing.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>CheckFree Corp on Monday said will provide home banking and bill payment processing for KeyCorp.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, CheckFree will provide services for KeyBank, National Association, which is Keybank's nationwide banking subsidiary.</p>
<p>CheckFree said it will also provide remittance processing for KeyBank's consumer and small business electronic bill paying services.</p>
<p>Financial details of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
